---
import ResearchLayout from "../../layouts/ResearchLayout.astro";
---
<ResearchLayout title="P5｜Platform Bottleneck｜J 的世界 Research" page="P5" section="PLATFORM BOTTLENECK">
<div class="poster">
 <div class="poster-inner">
  <div class="poster-top"><div class="poster-kicker">P4 · PLATFORM BOTTLENECK</div><div class="poster-title">效能往上走，<br/>瓶頸也一起往上走。</div><div class="poster-sub">AI 平台真正面對的，是一堵「系統級」的牆</div></div>
  <div class="bottleneck">
   <div class="pressure"><div>AI Models<br/><small style="color:#687789">模型規模 ↑</small></div><div>Compute<br/><small style="color:#687789">運算量 ↑</small></div><div>Memory<br/><small style="color:#687789">頻寬需求 ↑</small></div><div>Power<br/><small style="color:#687789">功耗 ↑</small></div></div>
   <div class="wall"><b>PHYSICS WALL</b></div>
   <div class="solution-list"><div class="solution"><b>Advanced Packaging</b><span>把更多功能整合進同一系統</span></div><div class="solution"><b>Optical Interconnect</b><span>降低高速資料傳輸的成本</span></div><div class="solution"><b>Glass Core / Materials</b><span>重新思考載板與材料能力</span></div><div class="solution"><b>Thermal / Power</b><span>讓整個平台能真正運作</span></div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="poster-footer"><strong>THE BOTTLENECK</strong><span>Compute · Memory · Power · Heat</span><span>P4</span></div>
 </div>
</div>
<div class="note"><strong>核心概念</strong>當運算、資料、功耗與散熱一起成長，單靠製程縮小已經不足以解決所有問題，系統級創新因此變得重要。</div>
</ResearchLayout>
